# Runner-generated build artefacts — excluded from the `vercel deploy` upload.
#
# The decoupled pipeline runs `npm run generate` on the GitLab runner BEFORE
# `vercel deploy` (to populate S3 + the freshness marker), which fills these
# dirs. Vercel's own build regenerates/restores them on its cached path, so
# shipping them as deployment source is pointless — and it blows Vercel's 1 GB
# upload limit (data/download/grants.json alone is ~1.1 GB). Excluding them
# restores the upload to just the repo source, as it was before generate moved
# onto the runner. (These are all gitignored build output; data/source/ is
# committed source and intentionally NOT listed here.)
data/download/
data/dist/
public/data/
public/export/
public/grants/
public/clinical-trials/
